factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the bee attack happened 'on Wednesday' (புதன்கிழமை), which matches the article, so this is fine; however the reel_script and slides say Murugesh died on 'the 14th' without the month/context stated in the article, which is consistent with the article only as 'கடந்த 14-ஆம் தேதி' (last 14th); the slide and reel present it as a fact of the same kind, acceptable.
  The slides_spec hl2 line 'தோட்டத்தில் வேலை செய்தபோது' and the slide line 'படுகாயமடைந்தவரை கோவையில் உள்ள தனியார் மருத்துவமனைக்கு' are incomplete, fragmentary phrases that lack a verb and have no clear meaning on their own, so they are ungrammatical as slide text.
  The slides_spec line 'குமாரபாளையத்தில் முருகேஷ் என்பவர் <b>14ஆம் தேதி</b> தேனீ' is cut off mid-sentence and contains raw HTML markup, so it does not form a clear sentence.
  The slide line 'அதே சேவூர் பகுதியில் இரண்டாவது உயிரிழப்பு' says the second death was in the same Sevur area, which is a claim not stated that way in the article (the article says Kumarapalayam, near Sevur), mixing the location of two different incidents into one claim.
  The slide 'கவனமாக இருங்கள்' (be careful) is an advisory not present in the article, an invented detail.
